<p>Haaayee hussain bewatan (2) khanjar tale hu pyaasa, &nbsp;bhai raha na beta ,ay waarise rukaiya nana se jaake kehna , maine nibhaya waadaa</p> 
<p>Ammaa…..haaaye</p> 
<p>Amma gawah rehna (6)</p> 
<p>&nbsp;</p> 
<p>Khanjar tale bhi dekho sajde me sar hai mera</p> 
<p>Nau laakh &nbsp;qaatilo ne tanha samaj ke ghera</p> 
